description = "Made by a Chain that starts with {n:catch} and ends with Elbow. Puts the enemy you caught on the floor: it is Taken Down for {b:TAKEDOWN_TIME} sec. A boss can't be put down: it clears as much of your Bruise as your caught hit dealt instead."
